rmal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=247 valign=top style='width:185.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:15.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=366 valign=top style='width:274.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HBsAG Elisa<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.0pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COI<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=247 valign=top style='width:185.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt;1.0\r\n  NEGATIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <td width=366 valign=top style='width:274.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology\r\n  : ELISA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=247 valign=top style='width:185.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.15pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COMMENT\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Hepatitis\r\nB virus (HBV) is a member of the Hepadna virus family causing infections of the\r\nliver with extremely variable clinical features. Hepatitis B is transmitted\r\nprimarily by body fluids especially serum and also spread effectively sexually\r\nand from mother to baby. In most individuals HBV hepatitis is self limiting,\r\nbut 1-2% normal adolescents and adults develop chronic Hepatitis. Frequency of\r\nchronic HBV infection is 5-10% in immunocompromised patients and 80% in neonates.\r\nThe initial serological marker of acute infection in HBsag which typically\r\nappears 2-3 months after infection and disappears 12-20 weeks after onset of\r\nsymptoms. Persistence of HBsag for more than six months indicates development\r\nof carrier state or chronic liver disease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>USES<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u25cf\r\n<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Routine\r\nscreening of blood and blood products to prevent transmission of Hepatitis B\r\nVirus \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\r\n(HBV) to recipients<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u25cf\r\n<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>To\r\ndiagnose suspected HBV infection and monitor the status of infected individuals<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u25cf<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>For prenatal screening\r\nof pregnant women<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"157.5pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 31.5pt"}}